+1 on option C.

One addition: include a "version" field in the JSON so we can
evolve the format without breaking existing clients:

  event: new-mail
  data: {"v":1,"folder":"inbox","count":3,"html":"<div...>"}

Also, we should use the SSE "id" field with a monotonic counter
so clients can resume after disconnects:

  id: 42
  event: new-mail
  data: {"v":1,...}

The EventSource API handles reconnection and Last-Event-ID
automatically, which is nice.

- Charlie

